meta {
  name: Search Entries
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.EntryService/SearchEntries
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "query": "button",
    "pagination": {
      "page": 1,
      "perPage": 20
    },
    "scopeId": ""
  }
}

docs {
  # Search Entries

  Searches translation entries by key or description.

  ## Authentication
  Requires valid access token.

  ## Request
  - `query` (required): Search term to match against key and description
  - `pagination.page` (optional): Page number, defaults to 1
  - `pagination.perPage` (optional): Items per page, defaults to 20, max 100
  - `scopeId` (optional): Filter results by scope UUID

  ## Behavior
  - Case-insensitive search (ILIKE)
  - Searches both `key` and `description` fields
  - Results include full entry details with localizations and scopes

  ## Response
  Returns matching entries with pagination.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "entries": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "key": "button.save",
        "description": "Save button label",
        "localizations": [...],
        "scopes": [...]
      },
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "key": "button.cancel",
        "description": "Cancel button label",
        "localizations": [...],
        "scopes": [...]
      }
    ],
    "pagination": {
      "total": 5,
      "page": 1,
      "perPage": 20,
      "totalPages": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Use Cases
  - Quick search for translation keys
  - Find entries by description keywords
  - Locate entries within a specific scope
}
